<title>USA: Barringer Technologies wins $2 mln order.</title>
<headline>Barringer Technologies wins $2 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barringer Technologies Inc said on Monday that it received a $2 million order from the U.S. Coast Guard for an undisclosed number of IONSCAN narcotics detectors.</p>
<p>The company expects to complete delivery of the detectors by the third quarter ending September 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
